<h1>My name really is Nikita.<br/> And my last name is Nova.</h1>
<h1>I’m a designer with experience as a manager, editor, programmer, screenwriter and art director</h1>
<h1>I live this life through curiosity, the drive to explore new things, and honesty</h1>
<i>Working as a designer since 2019</i>
<div class="ids__space L"></div>
<p>What I can do:</p>
<ul>
<li>Design brand identities and lead rebrandings</li>
<li>Edit video, animate graphics, do motion design</li>
<li>Draw typefaces and lettering</li>
<li>Draw illustrations </li>
<li>Vibe-code scripts to automate tasks</li>
<li>Build websites in HTML + CSS</li>
<li>Write anything from headlines to hour-long scripts</li>
<li>Work with 3D in Blender</li>
<li>Retouch photos</li>
<li>Prepare files for print, embroidery and other kinds of production</li>
<li>Work with neural networks for illustration, text, video, 3D and animation</li>
<li>Train AI models to create new styles</li>
<li>Code scripts, websites and apps</li>
</ul>
<p>That’s the kind of person I am ¯\_(ツ)_/¯</p>
<div class="ids__space L"></div>
